 contract.\n- Trace-schema comment documents in-place stage-vocabulary growth under evt 4 (no schema bump, by design).\n- Docs synced (README, MAP, CLAUDE). Suite re-frozen at 1679 IDs (+4: batch-verify contract + three approve arms).\n\n## Verification (branch HEAD 8ccb490bf)\n- Full suite: 1679 IDs, 0 failures (1645 passed / 34 skipped), `uv run --frozen pytest -q`.\n- Governed evidence: `tests-executed` and `host-qualification` claims recorded green, signed, producer `anthony`; sealed freeze ceremony 1562 passed / 117 expected skips, run_exit=0.\n- Gate: `ranex gate evaluate HEAD --approver reviewer_alice` → PASS (gate=landing, journal append seq 8).\n- Independent review audit: all four findings fixed (ADR-045:167 Auditability row; schema comment; approve serialize-before-open; `APPROVAL_PAYLOAD_TYPE` dedupe); vendored blob digests verified against ADR-045:52/64; `MAIN_PY_SHA256` pin green in-suite; flag-by-flag ADR-vs-parser clean; NOTICE conformed to the line-local contract test.\n- Verification-driven repairs landed with this branch: the three-way CAS race test's final assertion made schedule-robust (was nondeterministic and killed the nested governed spines); gating-spine failure messages now surface the nested pytest summary from stdout.\n\nRefs #65","created_at":"2026-09-02T12:23:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:28:10Z","closed_at":"2026-09-02T12:31:27Z","merged_at":"2026-09-02T12:31:27Z","merge_commit_sha":"28cdf2e75e38b661ab6ae76255f9155c44309aa7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonykewl20/ranex/pulls/72/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonykewl20/ranex/pulls/72/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonykewl20/ranex/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonykewl20/ranex/issues/72/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonykewl20